### Obtener todos los USUARIOS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users HTTP/1.1

### Obtener un USUARIO por email
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/email/admin@example.com HTTP/1.1

### Crear un USUARIO con POST
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/register HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json 

{
  "name": "Testing",
  "email": "testing@mail.com",
  "password": "Testingpassword0"
}

### Logear un USUARIO con POST
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@mail.com",
  "password": "Testingpassword0"
}
